('B16', 'M2', 'A_KORI draws the saw across the straw-wrapped block on the cart bed in long even strokes, the cut opening deeper into the ice with each pass and a ridge of white dust building along the blade, then leans his weight onto the saw as it goes through the last of the block and the cut piece drops free onto the straw, then sets the saw down across the cart bed and sweeps the loose dust off the edge with the side of his hand while it drifts down the side of the block', 'koriya', 'medium', 'Q', None, 'A_KORI standing at the cart with the saw resting in the half-made cut'),
