('B18', 'M2', 'A_KORI: the shafts of the handcart are gripped in both of their own hands low at the bottom of the frame with the lane opening out ahead, then the view moves on down the lane with the load pulling back against those hands, then it swings slowly to one side to take in the small figures strung out behind while dust drifts up around the wheels', 'koriya', 'pov_walk', 'Q', None, None),
