('B20', 'M2', 'A_KO: their own open palm fills the middle of the view with a chip of ice sitting on it, then their own fingers close over the ice and open again, then the melt spills off the heel of the hand and drips into the dust below while ice dust drifts off the straw on the cart beyond', 'koriya', 'pov_hand', 'Q', None, 'A_KO standing by the cart with his wet palm still open'),
('B21', 'M2', 'A_KO puts the last of the ice into his mouth, then wipes the wet palm down the front of his undershirt leaving a dark streak on the cotton, then turns and walks away from the camera after the cart while the dust he lifts drifts back down', 'koriya', 'wide', 'Q', None, None),

('B22', 'M2', 'A_HAHA settles a wrapped block of ice into the upper compartment of the chest, then presses it down into the corner with both palms until it seats flat, then steps back while a low mist of cold air rolls out over the rim and falls down the front of the chest and the steam from the kettle bends away', 'daidokoro', 'medium', 'Q', None, 'A_HAHA standing at the open chest, the ice settled in the top'),
